    m_Localized: 'WASD / arrow keys - move

      Mouse - look around

      Shift
      - sprint

      E - interact / pick up

      Q - put down

      Left click
      - buttons on screens and terminals

      Esc - close screen / pause

      {0}
      - quick save, {1} - quick load

      {2} - debug panel (development)'
