    m_Localized: Produced
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703353
    m_Localized: Active faults
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703354
    m_Localized: Welcome to the line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703355
    m_Localized: Today you run a frozen pizza line - from the dough mixer to the
      packed pizza. Walk with W A S D and look around with the mouse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703356
    m_Localized: Read the recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703357
    m_Localized: Aim at the recipe terminal and press {0}. It lists the Margherita
      values every machine needs. Close it with Esc.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703358
    m_Localized: Start the dough mixer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703359
    m_Localized: 'Go to a dough mixer and start it: green start button on the mixer,
      or its terminal ({0}).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703360
    m_Localized: Mixing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703361
    m_Localized: The mixer needs a moment. Make sure the pot stands under the drum
      - pick it up with {0}, put it down with {1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703362
    m_Localized: Tilt the drum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703363
    m_Localized: Mixing is done. Press the tilt button on the mixer with {0} - the
      dough ball drops into the pot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703364
    m_Localized: Pick up the pot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703365
    m_Localized: Aim at the pot with the dough and pick it up with {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703366
    m_Localized: Load the portioner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703367
    m_Localized: Carry the pot to the portioner and put it down on the lift with
      {1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703368
    m_Localized: Raise the lift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703369
    m_Localized: Press the lift-up button with {0}. The pot tips and the dough falls
      into the hopper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703370
    m_Localized: Portioning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703371
    m_Localized: The portioner cuts the dough into portions (target 250 g). If it
      is stopped, start it at its terminal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703372
    m_Localized: Forming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703373
    m_Localized: The portions wait in the buffer and run into the press, which forms
      the pizza base. Watch the first stroke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703374
    m_Localized: Watch the line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703375
    m_Localized: Open the line terminal next to the press with {0}. Green = running,
      amber = warning, red = fault.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703376
    m_Localized: The first pizza
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703377
    m_Localized: 'Follow your pizza: sauce and topping, oven, cooling, shock freezer,
      packaging. Quality is checked at the end of the line.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703378
    m_Localized: First batch done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703379
    m_Localized: Faults will happen - the HMI shows the cause and the remedy. Esc
      opens the pause menu with controls, save and load.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703380
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703381
    m_Localized: '[{2}] next step   [{3}] hide'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5442882299703382
    m_Localized: Restart tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5456202205442048
    m_Localized: Dosing station
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
